<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><font face="arial">Hi {!Core_Inquiry__c.OwnerFirstName},&lt;/br&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">You are receiving this alert because this person has expressed interest and requested Sales contact them as soon as possible. Please take a look at the details below and reach out within one business day.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">&lt;a class="primary" href="{!$Label.Core_Inquiry_Lead_Link}/{!Core_Inquiry__c.Core_Contact_InquiriesId__c}"&gt;Click here to see this person’s full profile in Salesforce CRM »&lt;/a&gt;&nbsp; &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">&lt;b&gt;Here are the person’s details:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;/br&gt;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">First Name: {!Core_Inquiry__c.Core_First_Name_Txt__c}&lt;/br&gt;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Last Name: {!Core_Inquiry__c.Core_Last_Name_Txt__c}&lt;/br&gt;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Company: {!Core_Inquiry__c.Core_AccountName__c}&lt;/br&gt;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Job Title: {!Core_Inquiry__c.Core_Title_Txt__c}&lt;/br&gt;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Phone Number: {!Core_Inquiry__c.Core_Phone_Txt__c}&lt;/br&gt;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Email: {!Core_Inquiry__c.Core_Email_Txt__c}&lt;/br&gt;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">How they found us originally: {!Core_Inquiry__c.Core_Contact_Lead_Source__c}&lt;/br&gt;&lt;/br&gt;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">&lt;b&gt;Some details about their Inquiry:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;/br&gt;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Area of Interest: {!Core_Inquiry__c.Core_Product_Interest_Txt__c}&lt;br&gt;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Purchase Timeframe: {!Core_Inquiry__c.Core_Project_Timeframe__c}&lt;/br&gt;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Project Details: {!Core_Inquiry__c.Core_Inquiry_Notes_Txt__c}&lt;/br&gt;&lt;/br&gt;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Please remember to log any calls or emails you make when engaging with this person. If you have questions regarding how to manage any Lead/Inquiry assigned to you, please &lt;a href="https://salescrm.intel.com/training-and-help/lead-management/"&gt;visit our Sales CRM training website&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/br&gt;&lt;/br&gt;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Sincerely,&lt;/br&gt;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Your Marketing Automation Team</font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
